      <p>Light mode is seen at ${String(e.rooms.light.lux)} lux, a normal lit room. Dark mode is seen at ${String(e.rooms.dark.lux)} lux, a dim room. Both come from the sRGB standard: its typical room and its reference room. CAM16 then gives three numbers people can feel: <em>lightness</em> (J), <em>colorfulness</em> (M) and <em>hue</em>.</p>
